+# Perf history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Cost of the `SessionStart` hook (the nine-check health gate), 5k-record store.
+
+- **Before** quick_check was taken off the read path: no measured number found
+  in this repo. The gate was authored directly in its O(1) form in the initial
+  commit (`2ff626a`); there is no prior commit or bench output with `quick_check`
+  running live on the read path to cite a number from.
+- **After** (current form: O(1) gate reading the recorded `quick_check` result,
+  the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter, and the `body` length `CHECK`
+  constraint, all added in the same commit): **p50 1.05 ms** at 5k records /
+  15k cues, measured via `muninn-bench perf` and recorded in the `2ff626a`
+  commit message.
